  40:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/FilteringFunctions/arm_fir_fast_q15.c **** /**
  41:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/FilteringFunctions/arm_fir_fast_q15.c ****  * @param[in] *S points to an instance of the Q15 FIR filter structure.
  42:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/FilteringFunctions/arm_fir_fast_q15.c ****  * @param[in] *pSrc points to the block of input data.
  43:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/FilteringFunctions/arm_fir_fast_q15.c ****  * @param[out] *pDst points to the block of output data.
  44:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/FilteringFunctions/arm_fir_fast_q15.c ****  * @param[in] blockSize number of samples to process per call.
  45:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/FilteringFunctions/arm_fir_fast_q15.c ****  * @return none.
  46:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/FilteringFunctions/arm_fir_fast_q15.c ****  *
  47:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/FilteringFunctions/arm_fir_fast_q15.c ****  * <b>Scaling and Overflow Behavior:</b>
  48:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/FilteringFunctions/arm_fir_fast_q15.c ****  * \par
  49:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/FilteringFunctions/arm_fir_fast_q15.c ****  * This fast version uses a 32-bit accumulator with 2.30 format.
  50:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/FilteringFunctions/arm_fir_fast_q15.c ****  * The accumulator maintains full precision of the intermediate multiplication results but provides
  51:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/FilteringFunctions/arm_fir_fast_q15.c ****  * Thus, if the accumulator result overflows it wraps around and distorts the result.
  52:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/FilteringFunctions/arm_fir_fast_q15.c ****  * In order to avoid overflows completely the input signal must be scaled down by log2(numTaps) bit
  53:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/FilteringFunctions/arm_fir_fast_q15.c ****  * The 2.30 accumulator is then truncated to 2.15 format and saturated to yield the 1.15 result.
  54:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/FilteringFunctions/arm_fir_fast_q15.c ****  *
  55:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/FilteringFunctions/arm_fir_fast_q15.c ****  * \par
  56:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/FilteringFunctions/arm_fir_fast_q15.c ****  * Refer to the function <code>arm_fir_q15()</code> for a slower implementation of this function wh
  57:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/FilteringFunctions/arm_fir_fast_q15.c ****  * Use the function <code>arm_fir_init_q15()</code> to initialize the filter structure.
  58:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/FilteringFunctions/arm_fir_fast_q15.c ****  */
